{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53403","headline":"登石伞峰 · 路黄中","name":"登石伞峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总戎诣幽胜，天使相追随。\n跻山玉笥号，到峰石伞奇。\n接武白云表，放情玄月时。\n恬旷薄沆瀣，峻极超崦嵫。\n平视羲和辔，俯观朝夕池。\n岩中复何揖，坐位多所宜。\n郁烈桂香眇，寅缘霞彩披。\n孤光逗绮翼，独秀分琼枝。\n灵气达心久，华容招目移。\n遂忘日云暮，登降不知疲。\n眷言丘壑士，养节松竹滋。\n感激旌盖顾，干以献贞词。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"路黄中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}